{
 "_rule": "Round-9 finder scopes. A seat is a list of blocks {files, steps, axis?}; files are globs over `git ls-tree -r --name-only <baseline>` (`*` stops at `/`, `**` crosses it) or the word \"rest\" (every universe file no seat of the dimension names explicitly). mode \"cells\": every (file, step, axis value) in universe x steps x axis is owned by exactly one seat. mode \"files\": every universe file by exactly one seat, every step by at least one. check_scopes.py enforces both and prints each seat's LOC; re-run it at the baseline, never carry its numbers.",
